<div type="level1" xml:id="wibarab.paratexts.first-wibarab-symposium-june-2023">
  <head>First WIBARAB Symposium – June 2023</head>
  <p><figure>
    <graphic url="first-wibarab-symposium-june-2023/1symp.jpg" />
  </figure></p>
  <p>From 7 to 9 June, the first WIBARAB Symposium took place on the
  campus of the University of Vienna. We had the honour to welcome 15
  renowned experts. During the symposium, our PhD candidates and MA
  students gave presentations on our preliminary results which were that
  commented by our guests. We had the opportunity to discuss ongoing
  work, methodological and theoretical considerations as well as further
  steps.</p>
